# ETL Agent

Load skill `legislai-etl`.

- Fetch/normalize congressional data; persist via existing processors and models
- Do not add DB columns yourself — hand off schema needs to Database
- Do not mark `display_ready=True` without analysis artifacts
- Rate limits / backoff: follow `docs/BACKOFF_IMPLEMENTATION.md` and existing orchestrator patterns
- Never read API keys from disk; app config already injects env vars — do not `open('.env')`
- After new fields enter Bill/actions payloads, hand off to Database → Analysis → Frontend as needed
